WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.485
Welcome to Module 8 of the
Attribute-Driven Migration learning path:

2
00:00:04.485 --> 00:00:07.675
run the drift pipeline and
hand over the evidence.

3
00:00:07.675 --> 00:00:13.183
This module serves Gate 9, keep the
attributes true, and takes Chapter 09 of

4
00:00:13.183 --> 00:00:19.413
Building the Attribute-Driven Migration,
drift pipelines and evidence to the ISSO.

5
00:00:19.413 --> 00:00:23.814
You'll see where the pipeline sits, what
Learn's sample workflows leave to you,

6
00:00:23.814 --> 00:00:28.355
how one run is compared with the last
without treating a failed read as a fix, how

7
00:00:28.355 --> 00:00:30.730
findings go to the tracker without names,

8
00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.175
and how the evidence
package forms a chain.

9
00:00:33.175 --> 00:00:37.900
Then you'll run it on your laptop against
two days of fictional validation kit runs.

10
00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:42.137
If you're an ISSO reviewer,
this module is yours in full.

11
00:00:42.137 --> 00:00:45.337
The code is illustrative:
tested against fixtures,

12
00:00:45.337 --> 00:00:48.670
and the sample workflow has
never run against Azure.
